{"speciesId":717,"names":{"fr":"Yveltal","es":"Yveltal","en":"Yveltal","ja":"イベルタル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Lorsque les plumes de sa queue et de ses ailes sont déployées et virent au rouge, ce Pokémon légendaire absorbe l’énergie vitale de ce qui l’entoure."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon legendario que, al extender sus alas y las plumas de la cola, emite un brillo carmesí que absorbe la energía vital de su enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When this legendary Pokémon’s wings and tail feathers spread wide and glow red, it absorbs the life force of living creatures."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"翼と 尾羽を 広げて 赤く 輝くとき 生き物の 命を 吸い取る 伝説の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand il sent que la fin de sa vie est proche, il aspire la force vitale des êtres vivants et retourne à l’état de cocon."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando su vida se extingue, absorbe la vitalidad de todos los seres vivos y regresa a su forma de crisálida."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When its life comes to an end, it absorbs the life energy of every living thing and turns into a cocoon once more."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"寿命が つきるとき あらゆる 生き物の 命を 吸いつくし 繭の 姿に 戻るという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lorsque les plumes de sa queue et de ses ailes sont déployées et virent au rouge, ce Pokémon légendaire absorbe l’énergie vitale de ce qui l’entoure."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pokémon legendario que, al extender sus alas y las plumas de la cola, emite un brillo carmesí que absorbe la energía vital de su enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When this legendary Pokémon’s wings and tail feathers spread wide and glow red, it absorbs the life force of living creatures."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"翼と 尾羽を 広げて 赤く 輝くとき 生き物の 命を 吸い取る 伝説の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quand il sent que